====== The net ======

The net meets on Monday nights. The [[https://example.org/net|net page]] has the times.

===== Who checks in =====

  * Regulars
  * Visitors
  * Relays

===== Frequencies =====

^ Repeater ^ Frequency ^
| Main     | 147.040   |
| Backup   | 444.100   |

The [[https://example.org/repeaters|repeater list]] is kept up to date.
